# Git-ignored files copied into every worktree Claude Code creates.
# A worktree never carries ignored files, so without this an agent lands with
# no environment and cannot tell "the env is missing" from "the code is broken"
# — it burns its self-heal budget fixing code that was never broken.
# Dependencies are NOT listed here: they are installed in the worktree, not copied.
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.development.local
.env.test
.env.test.local
.env.production
.env.production.local
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/CLAUDE.local.md
